    "title": "Rain Today, Milder Sunday Across Minnesota - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Minnesota’s weekend begins with rain, drizzle and cool temperatures across many communities Saturday. Sunday brings warmer weather and fewer rain interruptions, although clouds will linger. The National Weather Service expects Saturday’s rain to spread from west to east, with the more substantial rainfall focused across western and central Minnesota. Read full article\n3",
